  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "For absolute least value of <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>or</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br />So, absolute value is equal to <math><mn>2</mn></math>",
